WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
Find your shop, then tap Book Here.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.710
Choose a date and an available time.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.850
Select Brake Repair, then tap Apply.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.470
Choose Kia, the model, and year.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.470
Describe the symptoms.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.050
Submit your booking request.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.130
The shop reviews and confirms.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.250
Next: Photos and the AI report.
